# mrefd interlink file.
# Peer-reflector entries. mrefd hot-reloads on change.
#
# UDP forms (legacy interlink):
#   M17-QQQ  ABC                          DHT-based peer discovery
#   M17-URF  45.32.11.22  17000  BCD      static IP/port
#   M17-QQQL 44.45.45.100 ABC             pre-1.0 "legacy L" peer
#
# TLS forms (authenticated, IP-independent):
#   Hub: register an operator's key (one per operator, not per node). Their
#   nodes may each assert one of these modules and appear as W5GGW-B, ...
#     W5GGW    BCD  key:/etc/mrefd/tls/peers/W5GGW.pub.pem
#   Field node: dial the hub, asserting the ONE module this node links.
#     M17-HOM  B    tls:home.example.org:17000  servercert:/etc/mrefd/tls/home.pem
